 "answer_raw": "The newest lineup is the **iPhone Duo** (as of Oct 2026) [1].\n\nI didn't find the specific retail prices for the iPhone Duo (check the Apple Store for current pricing) [1].\n\nUpgrading from an iPhone 14 to the latest model is a significant jump that will yield noticeable improvements in performance and features. Since your current 14 is likely facing battery capacity degradation and may lack the hardware required for the latest on-device intelligence features [4][5], moving to the Duo is a clear path to modernizing your hardware.\n\n**The iPhone Duo** is the best option for a meaningful upgrade.\n\n**iPhone 14** — a solid budget option for basic tasks, but lacks the latest intelligence-focused hardware [2][5].",
